{
  "transcript": {
    "duration": 387.71,
    "segments": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 0.10000000000000009,
        "end": 2.95,
        "text": "Good evening, sir; what are you looking for to day?"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 5.0,
        "end": 10.75,
        "text": "A basic forty three inch smart tv, around twenty five thousand, mainly for news and cricket."
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 11.9,
        "end": 20.55,
        "text": "This one is twenty three thousand nine hundred ninety; it's a forty three inch smart tv, and the usual streaming apps are included."
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 21.55,
        "end": 28.862,
        "text": "Looks okay from here. We have a window opposite the tv though. Will the picture look dull during the day?"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 29.912,
        "end": 43.762,
        "text": "Some reflection will be there. You could consider this premium forty three inch model at thirty thousand nine hundred ninety instead. It has a brighter panel and better reflection handling. Shall I show you the same cricket clip on both?"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 44.662,
        "end": 50.712,
        "text": "Yes, please; seven thousand extra is quite a jump. Apart from the screen, what changes?"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 51.836000000000006,
        "end": 62.836000000000006,
        "text": "The premium one also has stronger built in speakers and an extra HDMI port; both have the apps you asked about, and both come with a one year manufacturer's warranty."
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 63.336000000000006,
        "end": 68.936,
        "text": "Let me watch for a minute. Yes, I can see the difference on the grass and the players' faces."
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 69.786,
        "end": 75.236,
        "text": "We keep our T_V_s for years. Okay, I'll take the thirty thousand nine hundred ninety one."
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 76.028,
        "end": 89.628,
        "text": "Sure, sir, would you also like an extended warranty for two thousand nine hundred ninety nine rupees? It adds two years of coverage after the manufacturer's first year. So the total coverage period becomes three years."
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 90.72800000000001,
        "end": 97.128,
        "text": "Another three thousand? Let me understand it first; does it cover the panel or only the smaller parts?"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 98.31400000000001,
        "end": 105.464,
        "text": "This plan covers electrical and mechanical failures, including panel failure, subject to the written terms."
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 106.464,
        "end": 109.76400000000001,
        "text": "Accidental damage and a cracked screen aren't covered."
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 110.714,
        "end": 113.26400000000001,
        "text": "Here, these are the coverage and exclusion sections."
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 114.76400000000001,
        "end": 124.644,
        "text": "Give me a moment to read this ... okay, I understand it's not accidental damage cover. Fine. Add the extended warranty also."
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 125.59400000000001,
        "end": 135.594,
        "text": "That makes thirty three thousand nine hundred eighty nine for the T_V_ and extended warranty together-I'll list them separately on the bill. Shall I arrange delivery to your home?"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 136.294,
        "end": 137.544,
        "text": "Yes, please."
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 138.44400000000002,
        "end": 143.994,
        "text": "Tomorrow afternoon would be good; I'll give you the address and please include the warranty document with the bill."
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 152.81,
        "end": 155.85999999999999,
        "text": "Hello, sir; bataye kya dikhaun?"
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 156.85999999999999,
        "end": 164.26,
        "text": "Ye displaywala Lenovo laptop chahiye, sola Gb RAM aur paanch sou baara s s d wala. Kya price hai?"
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 165.01,
        "end": 173.41,
        "text": "Sir, yeh forty two thousand nine ninety ka hai, g s t included. Same configuration ka sealed piece available hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 174.16,
        "end": 180.02,
        "text": "Mainly Excel aur video calls ke liye hai. एक बार कीबोर्ड और स्क्रीन चेक करलू"
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 180.42000000000002,
        "end": 187.07,
        "text": "हां सर, आराम से ये डेमो यूनिट पे एक्सल खोल देता हूं आप टाइपिंग भी चेक कर लीजे"
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 188.57,
        "end": 193.32,
        "text": "हाँ, कीबोर्ड ठीक लग रहा है यही लैपटॉप फाइनल कर दो"
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 194.406,
        "end": 209.05599999999998,
        "text": "बिलकुल सर, इसके साथ वावलेस माउस और पैडेड स्लीव का बंडल भी है. अलग लेंगे तो दोनों दो हजार अठानवे के है. लैपटोप के साथ एक हजार चार सो नानवे में पड़ेंगे. आड करना चाहेंगे?"
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 210.036,
        "end": 218.936,
        "text": "Acha, matlab ek hazaar chaar sau ninyaanve mein mouse aur sleeve dono, sleeve is laptop ko fit aayegi."
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 219.336,
        "end": 229.536,
        "text": "Ji, dono included hain-yeh isi size ki sleeve hai. Dekhiye, laptop easily fit ho raha hai aur zip thee properly bandh ho rahi hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 230.936,
        "end": 235.586,
        "text": "Theek hai, dono add kar do, office le jaane ke liye sleeve bhi kaam aayegi."
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 236.586,
        "end": 245.936,
        "text": "Done, sir. Laptop aur bundle milake total pachchan hazaar chaar sau navas hoga. Payment card se karenge ya UPI?"
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 247.436,
        "end": 250.936,
        "text": "U p i karunga. Bill mere naam pe bana dena."
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 251.836,
        "end": 253.036,
        "text": "Number bata deta hoon."
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 253.836,
        "end": 260.386,
        "text": "Ji, sir. Details le leta hoon. Phir sealed box ka serial number bill se match karwa deta hoon."
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 260.942,
        "end": 263.342,
        "text": "Mouse aur sleeve bhi saath pack kar denge."
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 263.892,
        "end": 268.04200000000003,
        "text": "Haan, perfect. QR dikha do, payment kar deta hoon."
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 276.992,
        "end": 280.742,
        "text": "Ji bhaisahab, bataye kaunsa phone dekhna hai?"
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 282.092,
        "end": 287.492,
        "text": "Kal jo ekso athais GB wala phone dekha tha, chaarahazar nauson nabhe ka."
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 288.468,
        "end": 310.51800000000003,
        "text": "वही लेना है नील रंग में है हाँ जी नीला है ये रहा सीलबन डिब्बा बिल इसी नाम से बना दू जो आपने कल बताया था हाँ राजेश कुमार फोन खोल कर एक बार चालू भी कर दीजियेगा बिल्कुल इसके साथ कवर और टेमपर ग्लास का पोंबो लगा दू"
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 310.996,
        "end": 313.796,
        "text": "दोनों मिलाकर छे सो नब्बे रुपए पड़ेंगे।"
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 314.096,
        "end": 320.14599999999996,
        "text": "नहीं भईया, छः नाइन नाइन और नहीं खर्च करने, अभी बस फोन ही दीजिये."
      },
      {
        "id": 39,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 321.296,
        "end": 330.546,
        "text": "ठीक है, कॉंबो छोड़ दीजिए, सिर्फ साधारन टैंपर्ड ग्लास लगवा लीजिए, वन नाइन्टी नाइन का है, कवर फिर कभी ले लेना।"
      },
      {
        "id": 40,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 331.346,
        "end": 334.39599999999996,
        "text": "वन हंड्रेड नाइन्टी नाइन में लगा कर देंगे न?"
      },
      {
        "id": 41,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 335.42400000000004,
        "end": 336.97400000000005,
        "text": "लगाने का अलग से तो नहीं है?"
      },
      {
        "id": 42,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 337.774,
        "end": 344.47400000000005,
        "text": "नहीं जी, लगाने समेत एक सो उन्यानवे है, आपके सामने साफ करके लगा दूँगा."
      },
      {
        "id": 43,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 345.47400000000005,
        "end": 349.92400000000004,
        "text": "अच्छा, तो सिर्फ ये ग्लास लगा दीजिए, कवर नहीं चाहिए."
      },
      {
        "id": 44,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 350.574,
        "end": 358.574,
        "text": "जी, सिर्फ फोन और एक टैंपर्ड ग्लास, कोई पंद्रह हजार एक सो अठानवे रुपए हुए, भुक्तान कैसे करेंगे?"
      },
      {
        "id": 45,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 359.374,
        "end": 373.47400000000005,
        "text": "युपिआइ कर देता हूं यह सामने वाला क्यूआर है हां जी इसी पर भुक्तान आ गया है यह आपका बिल और फोन भी चालू हो गया है अब ग्लास लगा देता हूं"
      },
      {
        "id": 46,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 374.374,
        "end": 378.97400000000005,
        "text": "ठीक है भाईया लगादेजिये डिब्बा भी साथ रख देना"
      }
    ],
